 Freezing Time Guardian</strong>, reverts to <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Time%20Guardian\">The Time Guardian</a>, then shifts to <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Blazing%20Time%20Guardian\">The Blazing Time Guardian</a> before returning to <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Time%20Guardian\">The Time Guardian</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUse <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a>, which will also cause <a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Time\">Lost Times</a> to spawn; kill them and use their corpse on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Waster\">Time Waster</a> to eliminate them, as they are invulnerable to player damage. Using <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a> in this phase heals the boss.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 29 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>85-377</td>\n<td>223.9</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\